    "long_instructions": "\r\n## Add Transparency\r\n\r\nAt the end of each filter function, update `resultCount.textContent` with a clear **transparency label**.\r\n\r\nTell the AI:\r\n\r\n* which filter you added or changed\r\n* what the filter means for the user\r\n* that the transparency label should go at the end of the filter function\r\n\r\nYour label should help users understand what they are seeing and what may be left out.\r\n\r\n"
